OL,3,GNEWSAThey found tumours on my lungs - I
OL,4,Athought I was going to die
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Mel McKechnie was first told she
OL,7,Fhad cancer, she said she "suddenly went
OL,8,Fcold".
OL,10,FShe said she had been a 40-a-day smoker
OL,11,Fof cigarettes when she was diagnosed
OL,12,Fwith lung cancer following an
OL,13,Finvitation for screening.
OL,15,FThe 63-year-old is now backing the NHS
OL,16,Fcancer awareness bus tour, which will
OL,17,Fvisit communities across Nottingham
OL,18,Fcity and Nottinghamshire offering free
OL,19,Fcancer advice, screening information,
OL,20,Fhealthy lifestyle support and mini
OL,21,Fhealth checks.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
