OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAThey found tumours on my lungs - I
OL,4,Athought I was going to die
OL,5,
OL,6,FMcKechnie said: "I have a simple
OL,7,Fmessage - if you are invited for NHS
OL,8,Fcancer screening programme, do take up
OL,9,Fthe offer. If cancer is caught early
OL,10,Flike mine, it can make a big
OL,11,Fdifference."
